  "schema:description": "Project developed by Giovanni Federico (Università di Pisa) and Antonio Tena Junguito (Universidad Carlos III de Madrid). This data base outlines changes in world trade from 1800 to 2016. Dataset: Morocco\n\nTechnical information: Microsoft Excel\n\nOther: Web site: <strong><a href=\"https://www.uc3m.es/tradehist_db\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.uc3m.es/tradehist_db</a></strong> </br> <strong><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/d/viewer?hl=en&mid=1YZBnV4ggwnfy24LZmASMr2QWk-EsZI_p&ll=31.999999999999996%2C-6&z=6\" target=\"_blank\">SEE MAP</a></strong>",
